  "ingredients": [
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "16 ounce ribeye steak",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon ghee",
    "1 teaspoon olive oil",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "2 tablespoon worcestershire sauce",
    "12 ounce spring mix"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Mince garlic. Split into two portions and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the rib eye into strips.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix the first half of minced garlic, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add ribeye strips to the bowl with the spice mix and toss to evenly season.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let rib eye and spice mix sit for 5 minutes to marinade. Then, add ghee to the bowl and toss to coat the beef strips.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate pan, fry the remaining half of minced garlic in olive oil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat cast iron pan and separate pan on a stove while the garlic is cooking. Do not add oil to the cast iron pan, it needs to be dry and very hot.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set aside the pan of garlic to cool once it is brown and crisp.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the cast-iron pan is hot, place ribeye strips into cast iron pan to sear.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn once one side of the beef is brown and slightly charred.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the other side is seared, add the butter and Worcestershire sauce.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/keto-beef-salpicao-17.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the butter melt then toss to coat the beef strips evenly. Serve on a bed of greens. Top with fried garlic and any additional fat from the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/beef-salpicao/#wprm-recipe-52842-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
